# Data, indices and model artifacts -- all built locally, none of it belongs in git.
# Anchored with a leading slash: these name directories the USER creates at the repo root. Unanchored,
# `data/` matches a directory called `data` at any depth, which silently excluded vendored
# `verl/trainer/config/data/legacy_data.yaml` -- a file `ppo_trainer.yaml` loads in its Hydra defaults
# list, so a fresh clone failed to compose a config and could not train at all.
/data/
/indices/
/corpus/
/outputs/
/runs/
/checkpoints/
/wandb/
*.parquet
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.safetensors

# Service logs from scripts/serve_*.sh
*.log

# Build artifacts
*.zip
